    "NSFileManager.AppSupportError" : {
      "comment" : "Error shown when the application support directory could not be created; placeholder is the underlying error message",
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Beim Suchen oder Erstellen Ihres Application-Support-Verzeichnisses ist ein Problem aufgetreten. iTerm2 funktioniert erst dann einwandfrei, wenn dieses Problem behoben ist.\n\nEs sollte sich unter ~/Library/Application Support/iTerm2 befinden.\n\nDer Fehler lautete:\n%@"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "There was a problem finding or creating your application support directory. iTerm2 won't work very well until this problem is fixed.\n\nIt should be at ~/Library/Application Support/iTerm2.\n\nThe error was:\n%@"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hubo un problema al buscar o crear tu directorio de soporte de aplicaciones. iTerm2 no funcionará muy bien hasta que se solucione.\n\nDebería estar en ~/Library/Application Support/iTerm2.\n\nEl error fue:\n%@"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un problème est survenu lors de la recherche ou de la création de votre répertoire Application Support. iTerm2 ne fonctionnera pas correctement tant que ce problème ne sera pas résolu.\n\nIl devrait se trouver dans ~/Library/Application Support/iTerm2.\n\nL’erreur était :\n%@"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si è verificato un problema nel trovare o creare la directory Application Support. iTerm2 non funzionerà bene finché il problema non sarà risolto.\n\nDovrebbe trovarsi in ~/Library/Application Support/iTerm2.\n\nL’errore era:\n%@"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "アプリケーションサポートディレクトリの検索または作成中に問題が発生しました。この問題が修正されるまで、iTerm2は正常に動作しません。\n\nこれは~/Library/Application Support/iTerm2にあるはずです。\n\nエラーは次のとおりです:\n%@"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "응용 프로그램 지원 디렉토리를 찾거나 생성하는 데 문제가 발생했습니다. 이 문제가 해결될 때까지 iTerm2가 제대로 작동하지 않습니다.\n\n디렉토리는 ~/Library/Application Support/iTerm2에 있어야 합니다.\n\n오류:\n%@"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ocorreu um problema ao localizar ou criar o diretório de suporte do aplicativo. O iTerm2 não funcionará muito bem até que este problema seja resolvido.\n\nEle deveria estar em ~/Library/Application Support/iTerm2.\n\nO erro foi:\n%@"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Возникла проблема при поиске или создании каталога поддержки приложений. iTerm2 не будет нормально работать, пока эта проблема не будет устранена.\n\nОн должен находиться по адресу ~/Library/Application Support/iTerm2.\n\nОшибка:\n%@"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Application Support dizininiz bulunurken veya oluşturulurken bir sorun oluştu. Bu sorun giderilene kadar iTerm2 pek iyi çalışmayacak.\n\nDizin ~/Library/Application Support/iTerm2 konumunda olmalıdır.\n\nHata şuydu:\n%@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "查找或创建应用支持目录时出现问题。在此问题修复前，iTerm2 将无法正常工作。\n\n它应位于 ~/Library/Application Support/iTerm2。\n\n错误为：\n%@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "尋找或建立你的 Application Support 目錄時發生問題。在問題修正之前，iTerm2 將無法正常運作。\n\n它應該位於 ~/Library/Application Support/iTerm2。\n\n錯誤內容：\n%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
